flowchart LR
    W[Send message] --> ID[Snowflake message ID]
    ID --> PT["Partition (channel_id, bucket), cluster message_id DESC"]
    PT --> C[(Cassandra / Scylla)]
    R[Load latest 50] --> CUR[Read current bucket, step back if short] --> C
    C --> HOT[Recent buckets - hot]
    C --> COLDB[Old buckets - cold]
    SRCH[Search] -.->|CDC| ES[(Elasticsearch)]
